msgid "File and directory paths here are relative to the addressbook's working directory, which is normally ~/.i2p/addressbook/ (Linux) or %LOCALAPPDATA%\\I2P\\addressbook\\ (Windows)."
msgstr "Pot do datotek in imenikov je tukaj relativna glede na delovni imenik naslovov, ki je običajno ~/.i2p/addressbook/ (Linux) ali %LOCALAPPDATA%\\I2P\\addressbook\\ (Windows)."

msgid "If you want to manually add lines to an addressbook, add them to the private or master addressbooks."
msgstr "Če želite v imenik naslovov ročno dodati vrstice, jih dodajte v zasebni ali glavni imenik naslovov."

msgid "The router addressbook and the published addressbook are updated by the addressbook application."
msgstr "Imenik naslovov maršrutnika in objavljeni imenik naslovov posodablja aplikacija imenika naslovov."

msgid "When you publish your addressbook, ALL destinations from the master and router addressbooks appear there."
msgstr "Ko objavite svoj imenik naslovov, se tam pojavi VSE destinacije iz glavnega in imenika naslovov maršrutnika."

msgid "Use the private addressbook for private destinations, these are not published."
msgstr "Za zasebne destinacije uporabljajte zasebni imenik naslovov; te niso objavljene."

