msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

msgid "What is the addressbook?"
msgstr "Kaj je imenik naslovov?"

msgid "The addressbook application is part of your I2P installation."
msgstr "Aplikacija imenika naslovov je del vaše namestitve I2P."

msgid "It regularly updates your hosts.txt file from distributed sources or \"subscriptions\"."
msgstr "Redno posodablja vašo datoteko hosts.txt iz razpršenih virov ali \"prijav\"."

msgid "Subscribing to additional sites is easy, just add them to your <a href=\"subscriptions\">subscriptions</a> file."
msgstr "Dodatnim spletnim mestom se naročite tako, da jih preprosto dodate v svojo <a href=\"subscriptions\">datoteko prijav</a>."

msgid "For more information on naming in I2P, see <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>the overview</a>."
msgstr "Za več informacij o poimenovanju v I2P si oglejte <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>pregled</a>."

msgid "How does the addressbook application work?"
msgstr "Kako deluje aplikacija imenika naslovov?"

msgid "The addressbook application regularly polls your subscriptions and merges their content into your \"router\" address book."
msgstr "Aplikacija imenika naslovov redno preverja vaše prijave in njihovo vsebino združi v vaš imenik naslovov \"maršrutnika\"."

msgid "Then it merges your \"master\" address book into the router address book as well."
msgstr "Nato tudi združi vaš \"glavni\" imenik naslovov v imenik naslovov maršrutnika."

msgid "If configured, the router address book is now written to the \"published\" address book, which will be publicly available if you are running an eepsite."
msgstr "Če je to nastavljeno, se imenik naslovov maršrutnika zapiše v \"objavljeni\" imenik naslovov, ki bo javno dostopen, če uporabljate eepsite."

msgid "The router also uses a private address book, which is not merged or published."
msgstr "Maršrutnik uporablja tudi zaseben imenik naslovov, ki ni združen niti objavljen."

msgid "Hosts in the private address book can be accessed by you but their addresses are never distributed to others."
msgstr "Do gostiteljev v zasebnem imeniku naslovov lahko dostopate vi, vendar se njihovi naslovi nikoli ne razširijo naprej."

msgid "The private address book can also be used for aliases of hosts in your other address books."
msgstr "Zasebni imenik naslovov lahko uporabite tudi za aliate gostiteljev v vaših drugih imenikih naslovov."

msgid "subscription log"
msgstr "dnevnik prijav"

msgid "Subscription Log"
msgstr "Dnevnik prijav"

msgid "Most recent (excluding bad domains)"
msgstr "Najnovejši (brez okvarjenih domen)"

msgid "subscriptions"
msgstr "prijave"

msgid "The subscription file contains a list of i2p URLs."
msgstr "Datoteka s prijavami vsebuje seznam naslovov URL i2p."

msgid "The addressbook application regularly checks this list for new eepsites."
msgstr "Aplikacija imenika naslovov redno preverja ta seznam glede na nova eepsite."

msgid "Those URLs refer to published hosts.txt files."
msgstr "Ti naslovi URL kažejo na objavljene datoteke hosts.txt."

msgid "See the FAQ for a list of subscription URLs."
msgstr "Za seznam naslovov URL prijav si oglejte FAQ."
